Following on from what Guido has said, you could test your hypothesis that the 
identical values produced by the newer version of gcrma are the problem by 
adding a small amount of random noise to the gcrma expression values and 
repeating the LPE analysis. I'm not familiar with LPE myself, but have seen 
similar problems due to the identical values produced by gcrma with other methods.

